당기말 및 전기말 현재 부채비율은 다음과 같습니다.</ifrs-full:DisclosureOfObjectivesPoliciesAndProcessesForManagingCapitalExplanatory>
  <ifrs-full:QualitativeInformationAboutEntitysObjectivesPoliciesAndProcessesForManagingCapital contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfRisksAxis_entity00760971_CapitalRiskOfRisksMemberOfDisclosureOfObjectivesPoliciesAndProcessesForManagingCapitalTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사의 자본관리목적은 건전한 자본구조를 유지하는 데 있습니다.</ifrs-full:QualitativeInformationAboutEntitysObjectivesPoliciesAndProcessesForManagingCapital>
