  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb1OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">계약 체결 후 2년 후 당사가 보유지분 전체를 제3자에게 매각하는 경우, 다른 주주들도 동반매각에 참여하도록 요구할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb2OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">계약 체결 후 5년 후 한 명 이상의 주주가 회사 지분의 60%를 매각하고자 하는 경우, 다른 주주들은 보유한 지분을 동일한 가격으로 매각에 참여할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb3OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">주식선택권을 보유한 종업원은 가득 완료 및 행사 후 지분의 50%의 수량에 대해, 본 건 인수시의 주당인수가격으로 매각할 수 있는 풋옵션을 보유하고 있으며 당사는 같은 조건으로 매입할 수 있는 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb4OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">1차 풋옵션 :  기존주주는 보유주식의 50%까지 특정 게임 출시 후 1년간의 성과지표에 특정 배수를 적용한 가치로 매각할 수 있는 풋옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb5OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2차 풋옵션 : 1차 풋옵션 행사 후 남은 잔량의 주식에 대해 2023년에서 2029년까지의 성과지표 중 12개월의 최대치에 특정배수를 적용한 가치로 매각할 수 있는 풋옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb6OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2차 풋옵션 종료 후 당사는 기존 주주의 주식을 매년의 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용한 가치로 매입할 수 있는 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAb7OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNeonGiantAbOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 자발적 퇴사 또는 정당한 사유로 퇴사하는 경우, 상기 풋옵션은 소멸되며, 당사는본 건 백업콜옵션 행사 전 12개월의 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용한 가치로 기존주주의 지분을 매입할 수 있는 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited1OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 인수 종료일로부터 4년 경과 후 6개월 간 보유 주식 중 64.28%에 대해 최초 인수 가치 측정에 사용된 Revenue Multiple을 기준으로 산정된 가치로 양도를 요구할 수 있는 1차 풋옵션을 보유하고 있으며, 10년 경과 후 3개월 간 잔여 지분 전량에 대해 동일 방식으로 양도를 요구할 수 있는 2차 풋옵션도 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited2OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 1차 풋옵션 종료 후 6개월 이내, 2차 풋옵션 종료 후 3개월 이내에 기존 주주가 보유한 지분을 동일한 평가 방식으로 매입할 수 있는 1차 및 2차 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited3OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 제3자에게 주식을 전량 양도하고자 할 경우, 당사는 동일 조건으로 우선매수권을 행사할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited4OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사가 보유 지분 전량을 제3자에게 양도하고자 할 경우, 기존 주주에게 동일 조건으로 전량 동반양도를 요구할 수 있는 권리가 부여되어 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited5OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사가 제3자에게 주식을 양도하고자 할 경우, 기존 주주는 동일 조건으로 보유 지분 전량을 함께 양도할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited6OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 인수 종료일로부터 4년간 주식의 양도, 담보 제공 등 처분이 제한되며, 이후에도 당사의 우선매수권 대상이 됩니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimited7OfAcquisitionContractsOfPreferredStockAndCommonStockOfNautilusMobileAppPrivateLimitedOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 경영권 변경이나 경쟁사와의 이해관계가 발생할 경우, 당사는 Accelerated Call Option을 행사하여 잔여 지분을 즉시 인수할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:DisclosureOfContingentConsiderationTextBlock contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">(7) 당기말 현재 당사의 조건부대가 내역은 다음과 같습니다.</entity00760971:DisclosureOfContingentConsiderationTextBlock>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_ifrs-full_ContingentConsiderationMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_entity00760971_UnknownWorldsEntertainmentIncAndEleventhHourGamesIncOfSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentConsiderationTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 종속기업인 Unknown Worlds Entertainment, Inc. 및 Eleventh Hour Games, Inc. 을 인수하면서 인수 이후 실적에 연동하여 인수대금을 지급하는 조건부대가 계약을 체결하였습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfObligationContingentLiabilities>
  <ifrs-full:EstimatedFinancialEffectOfContingentLiabilities contextRef="CFY2025eFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_ifrs-full_ContingentConsiderationMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_entity00760971_UnknownWorldsEntertainmentIncAndEleventhHourGamesIncOfSubsidiariesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentConsiderationTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">47678000000</ifrs-full:EstimatedFinancialEffectOfContingentLiabilities>
  <entity00760971:DisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTextBlock contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">(8) 당기말 현재 당사가 체결한 기타약정은 다음과 같습니다.</entity00760971:DisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTextBlock>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00760971_OtherCommitments1OfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 관계기업인 미래에셋맵스일반사모부동산투자신탁 66호('펀드')가 서울시 성동구 성수동2가 333-16 외 4필지에 개발 예정인 업무시설 및 근린생활시설에 대하여, 동 펀드의 집합투자업자와 향후 준공 완료 시점부터 10년간 임차하는 책임임차와 특정시점에 감정평가가격으로 우선매수할 수 있는 권리를 포함한 업무협약을 체결하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00760971_OtherCommitments2OfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 공동기업인 OVERDARE, Inc.에 대하여 합작투자계약상, 만장일치가 요구되는 결의사항 중 일부에 대해 교착상태가 발생하여 협의 기간내 합의에 이르지 못할 경우, 당사의 선택으로 공동참여자가 소유한 합작회사의 주식을 공정시장 가격으로 양수할 수 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00760971_OtherCommitments3OfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfOtherCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 2024년 8월 30일에 관계기업인 ㈜스푼랩스의 전환상환우선주, 전환우선주, 보통주를 인수하면서 특정 주주들과 주주간 계약을 체결하여 ㈜스푼랩스의 특정 주주가 보유한 주식의 최대 50%에 대해 2026년 7월 1일부터 6개월 이내에 적격 후속투자 가격 등으로 매각을 요청할 수 있는 매도청구권을 보유하고 있습니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
