  <entity00760971:DisclosureOfIndirectMeasurementOfFairValueOfGoodsOrServicesReceivedRestrictedStockUnitAssessedAtEndOfPeriodTextBlock contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">(10) 연결회사는 당기말 및 전기말 평가한 양도제한조건부주식(크래프톤)의 보상원가를 이항모형 및 몬테-카를로(Monte-Carlo)를 이용한 공정가치접근법을 적용하여 산정했으며, 보상원가를 산정하기 위한 제반 가정 및 변수는 다음과 같습니다.</entity00760971:DisclosureOfIndirectMeasurementOfFairValueOfGoodsOrServicesReceivedRestrictedStockUnitAssessedAtEndOfPeriodTextBlock>
  <entity00760971:ContingentConsiderationLiabilityOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025eFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfKindCoLtdOfTypesOfContractsMemberOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">803000000</entity00760971:ContingentConsiderationLiabilityOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfKindCoLtdOfTypesOfContractsMemberOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">인수 이후 실적에 연동하여 인수대금을 지급하는 조건부대가 계약을 체결하였으며, 이에 따라 803백만원의 부채를 인식하고 있습니다</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryInc4OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 대상회사가 신주발행시 의결권 비율 유지를 위해 필요한 수의 주식을 우선 인수할수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryInc3OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 자발적 퇴사 또는 정당한 사유로 퇴사하는 경우, 상기 풋옵션은 소멸되며, 연결회사는 본 건 백업콜옵션 행사 전 최근 분기 대차대조표상 순자산가액을 기업가치로 하여 기존주주의 지분을 매입할 수 있는 콜옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryInc2OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 연결회사가 보유 지분 전량을 제3자에게 양도하고자 할 경우, CHERRY Inc.의 최근 분기 대차대조표상 순자산가액을 기업가치로 하여 산출된 금액으로 연결회사에 매각할수 있는 풋옵션을 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryInc1OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfCherryIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 주식의 양도, 담보 제공 등 처분이 제한되며, 이후에도 연결회사의 우선매수권 대상이 됩니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
