  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeInc4OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 법률위반 등 기존주주들의 귀책사유가 발생한 경우, 기존주주에게 연결회사가 보유한 주식의 전부 또는 일부를 기존 주주에게 매도할 수 있는 권리를 보유 하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeInc3OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 매년 일정 경영성과 달성 시, 제 3의 평가기관을 통한 주식가치평가 혹은 상호 합의 하에 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용하여 산정한 가액으로 기존 주주가 보유한 주식 수량의 1/3을 한도로 기존주주가 보유한 주식을 매수할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeInc2OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주는 매년 일정 경영성과 달성 시, 제 3의 평가기관을 통한 주식가치평가 혹은 상호 합의 하에 성과지표에 특정배수를 적용하여 산정한 가액으로 보유 주식 수량의 1/3을 한도로 연결회사에게 매도할 수 있는 권리를 보유하고 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
  <entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_SignificantInvestmentsInSubsidiariesAxis_ifrs-full_SubsidiariesMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfContractsAxis_entity00760971_AcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeInc1OfAcquisitionContractsOfCommonStockOfFantomeIncOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 주주가 제3자에게 주식을 양도하려는 경우, 연결회사는 동일한 조건으로 양도하려는 주식을 매수할 수 있습니다.</entity00760971:MainConditionsShareholderAgreementOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersOfDisclosureOfShareholderAgreementWithExistingShareholdersTableOfItems>
